# --- Site ---
# Canonical origin for metadata, robots, and the sitemap. Optional in development.
# VITE_SITE_URL=https://errorwolf.dev

# --- Error monitoring (build time only) ---
# Uploads source maps to Sentry, so a stack trace in Sentry shows real function
# names. Optional: a build without it succeeds and ships minified traces.
# Set it as a secret build variable in the Cloudflare project.
#
# This is the only Sentry secret. The DSN is public by design and lives in
# src/lib/sentry/constants.ts, together with the org and the project.
# SENTRY_AUTH_TOKEN=
